{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23346","headline":"别苏州 · 白居易","name":"别苏州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"浩浩姑苏民，郁郁长洲城。\n来慙荷宠命，去媿无能名。\n青紫行将吏，班白列黎甿。\n一时临水拜，十里随舟行。\n饯筵犹未收，征櫂不可停。\n稍隔烟树色，尚闻丝竹声。\n怅望武丘路，沈吟浒水亭。\n还乡信有兴，去郡能无情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23346.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23346","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}